<title>USA: BayBank wins $22 mln West Springfield, Mass., BANs.</title>
<headline>BayBank wins $22 mln West Springfield, Mass., BANs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>BayBank said it won $22.4 million of West Springfield, Mass., bond anticipation notes (BANS).</p>
<p>The net interest cost (NIC) was 3.612 percent and a coupon of 3.75 percent.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
